Package: ramiga
Title: Emulating the Amiga Using the vAmiga Engine
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Pepijn", "de Vries", role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "pepijn.devries@outlook.com",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7961-6646")),
      person("Dirk", "Hoffmann", role = c("aut", "cph"))
    )
Description: This is an Amiga emulator based on the vAmiga project
    <https://github.com/dirkwhoffmann/vAmiga>.
    It provides low level access to the emulator and allows users
    to interact with the emulated machine through the console or
    scripts.
